{
  "suite": "GKOS-v0.83-development-R26-A14-overdue-review-and-exceptions",
  "standing": "Development fixtures for R26-A14, accepted under R26 (accepted in part 2026-10-07). Non-qualifying. Records use the portable gate fixture interface (kind deferred-review) with the overdue inputs R26-A14 defines, instead of a precomputed overdue boolean.",
